{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "75e5c8dc-4280-84fe-a558-6047d8264d2c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T17:45:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:36:39-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine Medeiros. I know it's after hours, so you've reached the recorded-line desk. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Yeah, I know City Hall's closed. It's almost quarter of six. Is this the right number for a storm drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:37:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, yes. Storm drains, flooding, anything from the weather. What's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's gurgling. Constantly. And there's a sewer smell coming up out of it. Really strong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Okay, so gurgling and a sewage smell. Is this one in the street, or out front of a building?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:38:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Street. Right in front of my place. Two twenty-three Bridge Street. In the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:38:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two twenty-three Bridge Street, the Point. Got it. And when did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:38:26-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After the storm. The one Friday into Saturday. Three days ago now. Water came up around it Saturday and it never really went down right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so since the coastal storm Friday into Saturday. Is there standing water there right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:38:59-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A puddle. Not huge. But the gurgling is the thing. And the smell. I can smell it from the front steps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:39:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Has it gotten into your house at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Not yet. But it was not this bad last winter. We had storms last winter. The drain was fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So this is new compared to last year. That's helpful to know. Let me write that down. Anything blocking the grate, like leaves, debris, trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:40:00-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some leaves. Sticks. Probably sand from the storm. But I'm not touching it. I just want it cleaned. Can you send someone to clean it out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:40:21-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put in a request for the drain to be cleaned and checked. I'll flag the odor too, since that can mean something's backed up further down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:40:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because it's been three days. Nobody's been by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:40:52-05:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. The crews have a lot of drains on the list after a storm like that, and the Point got hit pretty hard. I'll mark yours with the gurgling and the smell so it's not just a leaf job."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:41:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Loretta."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:41:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's Lorraine, but that's fine. Lorraine Medeiros."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:41:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. Lorraine. Medina, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:41:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Medeiros. M-E-D-E-I-R-O-S. Don't worry, it gets mangled a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Medeiros. Got it. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 34,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. Now let me read this back. Two twenty-three Bridge Street, storm drain in front of the house, gurgling, sewer smell, since the storm Friday into Saturday, some debris on the grate, not worse than last winter. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not worse than last winter. Better. I mean, last winter it was fine. This is worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:42:37-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, thank you. Last winter it was fine, this year it's worse. I'll put it that way. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four-oh-one, five five five, oh one eight seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five five five, oh one eight seven. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cristina Resendes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:43:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cristina Resendes. Can you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:43:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Resendes, got it. Okay, Cristina, the request is in. Someone from the department should get to it in the next several days, and if it looks like a bigger problem down the line, they'll send a different crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:43:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Several days? It's already been three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:44:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I can mark it high priority because of the smell. That moves it up the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:44:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do. I don't want this sitting there another week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:44:29-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've marked it. If it gets worse, or the water starts coming toward the house, call this line again, any hour, and tell them it's the Bridge Street one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:44:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Lorena. Lorraine. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. Have a good evening, Cristina."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T17:45:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
